Kau buat perangai di hari begini?

49:54.032 --> 49:55.242
Jawab.

49:55.325 --> 49:57.244
Mak cik dah suruh Gyeong-seok pegang.

50:01.581 --> 50:03.166
Mak.

50:04.167 --> 50:06.420
Mak!

50:17.723 --> 50:19.891
Sambil bercerita kuasa kesedihan.

50:23.020 --> 50:24.604
Dan berjalan menuju

50:26.064 --> 50:27.315
kesedihan penantian.
